      "attestations": [
        {
          "text": "CHU Kuei-chên 朱桂楨 (T. 幹臣, H. 璞庵, 覺修), 1767–1839, official, was a native of Shang-yüan (Nanking). His grandfather, Chu Lan 朱瀾 (T. 向源, H. 安齋), served for many years as an official in Chihli, finally rising to be intendant of the Ch'ing-ho Circuit at Paoting (1786–89, 1790).",
